The MIT license above covers the code of the Miyoo version (src/, js/menu.js,
js/dev.html, js/runtime.js, patches.mjs, the build scripts). These parts are
NOT under it and keep their own licenses (texts in App/Playload/licenses):

  App/Playload/playload.js, games.json, examples.json, src/glyphs8.h, src/logo8.h,
  docs/logo.png, App/Playload/icon.png
                        Built from Playload (github.com/kitao/playload),
                        (c) Takashi Kitao, MIT: its engine, sound compiler,
                        characters, examples, Arcade list and logo. The fonts
                        and data inside it are listed in Playload-third-party.md.
                        The Arcade games belong to their authors.
  App/Playload/playload-jit
                        Contains JavaScriptCore and WTF (WebKit), LGPL 2.1 with
                        BSD parts, and ICU (Unicode license). To relink it
                        against your own build of them, use this source and
                        github.com/mroxfordyazuka/jsc-miyoo.
  App/Playload/playload Contains QuickJS-ng, MIT.
  App/Playload/bin/curl curl 8.10.1 with OpenSSL 3.3.2, the static build
                        spruceOS ships (curl license; Apache 2.0).
  App/Playload/cacert.pem  Mozilla CA bundle, MPL 2.0.
  src/font_m5x7.h       m5x7 by Daniel Linssen (managore.itch.io/m5x7), used
                        under its own terms.
  src/ui.c              The UI kit is ArchiveTV's (github.com/mroxfordyazuka/ArchiveTV), MIT.
